# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ford_Fiesta
# Ford Fiesta Mk3 (BE-13): on sale from February 1989, UK sales from April
# 1989; production to February 1997, the last 18 months as the "Fiesta
# Classic". UK registrations peaked at 151,475 (1990) and were still 119,471 in
# 1997, a UK top-ten car throughout.
#
# Colours: Imperial Blue, Radiant Red, Moondust Silver, Ebony. The paint names
# are the actual Ford offerings with their availability years (Imperial Blue
# mica 1993-2005, Radiant Red 1988-2006, Moondust Silver 1991-2026, Ebony
# 1995-2005). These are the four largest measured DVSA first-registration
# shares over the model's road years 1994-1997: blue 24.2%, red 19.9%, silver
# 11.3%, black 8.8%. Green sat in the 20-25% "other" group and was the next
# candidate; it is not modelled.
#
# Dates are staggered per colour by observed road presence. Weights total 500,
# the 2026-11-15 anchor convention for the Fiesta (provisional; a central
# rebase follows), split 24.2:19.9:11.3:8.8.

